<%- include('head') %><%- include('header') %><main id="main" class="page-container"><div class="page-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">02 / SAVED IN TIME</p><h1>ARCHIVE<span>时间归档</span></h1><p>每一次记录，都是一个可以回来的存档点。</p></div><span class="archive-orbit" aria-hidden="true">◷</span></div><div class="archive-layout"><div class="archive-intro"><b><%= posts.length %></b><span>段留下的记忆</span><p>按时间向后翻阅，<br>也许会遇见当时的自己。</p></div><div class="archive-timeline"><% for(const year of [...new Set(posts.map(p=>p.date.slice(0,4)))]){ %><h2><%= year %><span>YEAR IN REVIEW</span></h2><% for(const month of [...new Set(posts.filter(p=>p.date.startsWith(year)).map(p=>p.date.slice(0,7)))]){ %><h3><%= month.slice(5) %> 月 <small><%= posts.filter(p=>p.date.startsWith(month)).length %> ENTRIES</small></h3><% for(const p of posts.filter(p=>p.date.startsWith(month))){ %><a class="archive-entry" href="<%= postUrl(p) %>"><time><%= p.date.slice(5).replace('-','.') %></time><span><small><%= p.category %> / DAY <%= p.day %></small><strong><%= p.title %></strong></span><b>↗</b></a><% } } } %></div></div></main><%- include('footer') %>
